# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client configuration (Vite). Values are baked into the browser bundle, so
# only put *public* values here (the anon/public key is safe to expose).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase project (optional). Leave unset to run fully local/offline.
#
# For the local docker stack, scripts/setup-docker.sh fills these in
# automatically (http://localhost:<KONG_HTTP_PORT> + the generated anon key).
# To point the app at a hosted project instead, set them by hand and do NOT
# run the docker stack's sync (or just ignore it).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker stack ports (used by scripts/setup-docker.sh; defaults shown).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WEB_PORT=8088
# KONG_HTTP_PORT=8000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Barry (AI assistant) — SERVER-SIDE. These live on the Supabase Edge
# Function, NOT in the browser.
#
#   Hosted project:  supabase secrets set \
#                       BARRY_BASE_URL="https://api.openai.com/v1" \
#                       BARRY_API_KEY="sk-..." \
#                       BARRY_EMBEDDING_MODEL="text-embedding-3-small"
#
#   Local docker:    uncomment the values below in this file, then re-run
#                    scripts/setup-docker.sh (or: make deploy-barry after a
#                    'docker compose up -d functions').
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works (OpenAI, Groq, Together, or a local
# server such as Ollama / LM Studio / vLLM). BARRY_MODEL is optional; when
# unset, Barry uses the model the server serves (GET /models). Pin it to pick
# one model on a multi-model server. BARRY_EMBEDDING_MODEL is optional; when
# unset, Barry falls back to keyword search over the corpus.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BARRY_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# BARRY_API_KEY=
# BARRY_MODEL=
# BARRY_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
